!insmath A=( $val9 $val15 ) + ( $val12 $val16 )
$().</span>	$val25	<p>
!insmath A=( $val9 $val15 ) + ( $val12 $val16 )
$()</p>	<span class="nowrap">
!insmath A = $val18 $val17 
